## Capture No known Allergy for the patient

tags: allergy

* Login to Bahmni as a "admin"
* Receptionist creates the "cure" patient and starts an IPD
* Open "Clinical" module
* Goto All sections and search the newly created patient
* Search and select patient
* Add "No known Allergy" for the patient
* Validate "No known Allergy" is added in patient clinical dashboard
* Navigate to medication from patient clinical dashboard
* Validate "No known Allergy" is added in medication page
* Goto to active visit
* Validate "No known Allergy" is added in patient visit page
* Add Allergy "Pollen"
* Validate No known Allergy is striked through in patient clinical dashboard
* Navigate to medication from patient clinical dashboard
* Validate No known Allergy is striked through in medication page
* Goto to active visit
* Validate No known Allergy is striked through in patient visit page
* Log out if still logged in